---
import PwaUpdateStatus from '../components/PwaUpdateStatus.svelte';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Update Wyreup</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Finish your work and close all Wyreup tabs and windows before reopening to use a waiting update." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Update Wyreup</h1>
      <p>A waiting update takes over after all tabs and windows using the previous version close.</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Finish your work and download your results in each Wyreup tab or window.</li>
        <li>Close all Wyreup tabs and windows, including this recovery tab.</li>
        <li>Reopen Wyreup to use the waiting update.</li>
      </ol>
      <p>This page does not check whether your other tabs have unfinished work. It does not clear your data, activate an update, or reload your tools.</p>
      <PwaUpdateStatus client:load />
      <noscript><p>Update checks need JavaScript. The instructions above still apply.</p></noscript>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(body) { margin: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; }
  main { max-width: 42rem; margin: 3rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
  li { margin: .75rem 0; }
</style>
